{#-
  One item of Procreator's list redone in the Suggestions chat (suggestions/chat.ts): the page
  first when it has changed since Procreator last saw it, then which item, what it is now, and the
  owner's notes on it, last. Takes the page as text ('' when it hasn't changed), the item's number
  from 1, the item as Procreator writes a change (change, as JSON), and the notes.
-#}
{% if page %}
<page>
{{ page }}
</page>

{% endif %}
Redo item {{ item }} of your list, and only that item, as the owner's notes on it say. The item as it stands:

<item>
{{ change }}
</item>

<notes>
{{ notes }}
</notes>

Answer with revise_change: a change to the same thing, redone as the notes say.
